WEBVTT

00:01:58.791 --> 00:02:02.975
because it meant that I could
make these physical objects,

00:02:02.999 --> 00:02:05.346
and I could make films from those objects.

00:02:06.333 --> 00:02:08.347
That's me riding on my bicycle.

00:02:08.371 --> 00:02:09.521
(Laughter)

00:02:15.122 --> 00:02:19.175
I made about 25 paper sculptures,

00:02:19.199 --> 00:02:21.196
each the size of a bicycle wheel.

00:02:22.191 --> 00:02:24.697
I brought them into the studio,

00:02:24.721 --> 00:02:25.911
spun them

00:02:25.935 --> 00:02:29.179
and shot them to make the film
"Copenhagen Cycles."

00:02:29.203 --> 00:02:32.064
(Music)